[07:00:27 INFO]: Fri, Nov 13 (1/9)
[07:00:27 INFO]: What's New (Nov 13)
[07:00:27 INFO]: New: one Skills panel for skills and magic
[07:00:27 INFO]: New commands
[07:00:27 INFO]:  /skillpanel - Open your Skills panel: your Power Level and Magic header, plus every skill with its level and XP progress.
[07:00:27 INFO]: Other changes
[07:00:27 INFO]:  - The panel opens with your character header: Power Level (all your mcMMO skill levels added together), then your Magic block: Magic Level and XP with its progress bar, your Rank and Class and the next rank, your mana and how fast it comes back, your casting boosts, your total casts, and Guild seals broken out of 5.
[07:00:27 INFO]:  - Under the header, every mcMMO skill is listed with its level and an XP progress bar with a percent, so you can see how close each skill is to its next level. Open a skill for its detail: XP into the level, XP still to go, and its rank when it has one. Salvage and Smelting are child skills: they show a level only, with no bar, because their levels come from their parent skills and they earn no XP of their own.
[07:00:27 INFO]:  - On a computer the panel is a chest menu. On phone, tablet and console it is a form showing the same header and skill lines, with a button for each skill, and if the form cannot open the same lines print in chat. Nothing about your skills, magic, mana or ranks changed: the panel only shows the same numbers /mcstats and /magiclevel already show, in one place.
[07:00:27 INFO]:  - The compass Skills & Perks button now opens the Skills panel (/skillpanel). The older skills menu still exists, with the perk ladders in brief, but the button no longer opens it. The full perk ladders are still on the website Skill Trees page, and each skill detail in the panel points there.
[07:00:29 INFO]: Fri, Nov 13 (5/9)
[07:00:29 INFO]: What's New (Nov 13)
[07:00:29 INFO]: Update: every section of the compass menu has its own colour
[07:00:29 INFO]: Other changes
[07:00:29 INFO]:  - On phone, tablet and console, every section of your compass menu now has its own colour. Travel is green, Me is light purple, Shops is gold, Help is red, Settings is yellow, and Chest Organization is dark gray. The colour shows on the section button in the picker and on the buttons inside each section page.
[07:00:29 INFO]:  - Spawn and Teleport stay blue at the top of the menu, exactly as before. Blue belongs to the pins now, not to any section, so you can spot them at a glance.
[07:00:29 INFO]:  - On a computer nothing changes. The menu grid keeps its coloured header panes, and the Travel pane stays blue by design: on a computer blue is the Travel header, while on a phone or console blue is the pins.
[07:00:29 INFO]:  - The commands catalogue stays plain, as before. The Back button stays plain too, and the list inside a section page stays plain; only the buttons carry the colour.
[07:00:31 INFO]: Fri, Nov 13 (9/9)
[07:00:31 INFO]: What's New (Nov 13)
[07:00:31 INFO]: New: browse old news by date
[07:00:31 INFO]: New commands
[07:00:31 INFO]:  /whatsnew bydate - Browse old news by month, then by day. By date reaches all the news, even from October.
[07:00:31 INFO]:    Or click By date at the top of /whatsnew list or on any news page.
[07:00:31 INFO]: Other changes
[07:00:31 INFO]:  - Open What's New, tap By date, pick a month, then a day. Days show the weekday and how many changes they hold.
[07:00:31 INFO]:  - The flat list still shows only the 10 newest entries. By date is the way back to older news.
[07:00:33 INFO]: Mon, Oct 26 (1/10)
[07:00:33 INFO]: What's New (Oct 26)
[07:00:33 INFO]: Stance lock no longer blocks your hotbar
[07:00:33 INFO]: Other changes
[07:00:33 INFO]:  - Fixed: in Fighter or Caster stance, your scroll wheel skips over the locked wand or weapon.
[07:00:33 INFO]:  - So every other hotbar slot, potions too, is always in reach.
[07:00:33 INFO]:  - On a controller, the bumpers skip it the same way. Tapping a slot works as before.
[07:00:33 INFO]:  - The locked item still never comes into your hand during the stance.
[07:00:35 INFO]: Mon, Oct 26 (10/10)
[07:00:35 INFO]: What's New (Oct 26)
[07:00:35 INFO]: Your Spell Book is organized
[07:00:35 INFO]: Commands that got better
[07:00:35 INFO]:  /spellbook - Spells sorted into groups like Healing, Defense and Damage.
[07:00:35 INFO]:    Or type /spellbook and click a group.
[07:00:35 INFO]: Other changes
[07:00:35 INFO]:  - Each group shows how many spells it has. Spells on your bar say which slot.
[07:00:35 INFO]:  - All spells A to Z is there too, a page at a time.
[07:00:35 INFO]:  - Gray spells are ones your wand gets at a higher rank.
[07:00:35 INFO]:  - Picking a spell for your bar starts with the groups too.
[07:00:37 INFO]: Recent news
[07:00:37 INFO]:  1. New: browse old news by date (Nov 13)
[07:00:37 INFO]:  2. Update: the Skills panel header follows the wand you carry (Nov 13)
[07:00:37 INFO]:  3. Update: the Travel pane on a computer is green now (Nov 13)
[07:00:37 INFO]:  4. New: buy a golden shovel at the Spawn Shop to claim your land (Nov 13)
[07:00:37 INFO]:  5. Update: every section of the compass menu has its own colour (Nov 13)
[07:00:37 INFO]:  6. New: one-tap Spawn and Teleport pins, and a menu order of your own (Nov 13)
[07:00:37 INFO]:  7. Update: perk descriptions and gold bars in the Skills panel (Nov 13)
[07:00:37 INFO]:  8. Update: perk ladders inside the Skills panel (Nov 13)
[07:00:37 INFO]:  9. New: one Skills panel for skills and magic (Nov 13)
[07:00:37 INFO]:  10. New: sections on the phone and console menu (Nov 12)
